  "prefLabel": "Liq 705.05 Liquor/Wine/Beverage Warehouser License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 705.05 Liquor/Wine/Beverage Warehouser License. Applicants for a liquor/wine/beverage/warehouse license shall complete and submit Form LTW-12, “License Type Worksheet-Liquor, Wine and Beverage Warehouser” (revised 8/2020) providing all required information and acknowledgments.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20",
